   "title": "What to listen for",
   "content": "<p>Indian and Punjabi rhythm is built on <strong>cycles</strong>: the tala in classical music (count it), the <strong>chaal</strong> in bhangra (feel its swing). Every question in this drill is answered by counting or by listening to how beats divide.</p>"
